      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'DAY 8 (I think).



    3 keys. 1 door. The exit.



    I''m not alone.

    There''s
    something here. BLACK.

    It moves in the dark.

    It follows.



    Find
    the keys.

    Don''t stop moving.



    It''s the only way out.'
