  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NotaPapel
  texto: "Four notes are hidden in this place.\r\nEach one holds a riddle.\r\nEach
    riddle reveals a color.\r\nFind them. Read them. Understand them.\r\nThe order
    in which you press the colors is the key.\r\nPress the four colors in the correct
    sequence.\r\nOnly then will the door open.\r\n\r\n\u2014 The answer is all around
    you."
  titulo: THE ORDER OF COLORS
